OnikiriStyleDemo: {
	MayoName: 绯村真夜
	L1: 月亮升起来了。绯红的,和我离开那晚一模一样
	L2: (纸垂在夜风里轻轻晃动,某种视线落在你肩上)
	L3: 别紧张,刀还在鞘里
	L4: 这块面板是新裱的:和纸吃了墨,边框是一笔收出来的,顶上那条绸子……嗯,是我系的。你要是盯着这行字看,应该能看到最新的字迹还带着一点没干透的绯色
	ChoicePrompt: 那么——想先看哪一样?
	C1: 看看奖励弹窗(绘马)
	C2: 把刚才的话再演一遍
	C3: 解开鬼切的封印
	C4: 今晚就到这里
	SealedHint: 封印中
	RewardLine: 拿好。普通的刀而已,但挂牌的样子你看到了
	ReplayLine1: 好,再来一遍。注意看说话人换行时,朱印是怎么重新盖下去的
	ReplayLine2: (无名的低语——这一行没有名牌,也没有印)
	Farewell1: 夜还长,茶就不留你了
	Farewell2: 下次再见时,希望是在正式的故事里
}

FirstMetHimayo: {
	SpeakerName: Himura Mayo
	Line1: ...I'm still alive?
	Line2: Wait, let me make sure... Is this some kind of spirit summoning?
	Line3: No.
	Line4: Why is my consciousness inside a sword now?
	Line5: My head hurts... I suppose I'm somewhere between a living person and something inhuman.
	Line6: I have absolutely no idea what happened...
	Line7: Still, from today onward, I hope we'll get along.
}

ToriiSealedDialogue: {
	L1: (You grip the hilt until your knuckles whiten—the blade does not budge, as if cast into the earth itself)
	L2: (From beneath the guard drifts a sigh almost too faint to hear, like a light sleeper turning over)
	L3: (...Not yet. This blade seems to be waiting for the day a great fire burns itself out)
}

ToriiShrine: {
	InteractHint: "[Right Click] Draw the blade"
	SealedHint: "[Right Click] Grip the hilt"
	InventoryFullHint: 背包已满，腾出一格再来拔刀
}

ItCametoThis: {
	Line1: 真不想走到这一步啊
	Line2: 从现在开始，这个世界我接管了
}

HimayoEyeOfCthulhuGift: {
	L0: We used to have a guy back home who slept with his eyes open.
	L1: Covers pulled up neat, just staring at the beam.
	L2: Makes you sleepy just looking. Never mind, drop it.
}

HimayoEvilBossGift: {
	L0Worm: Chunk after chunk jammed in the dirt... reeks.
	L0Brain: Brains aren't supposed to be out in the open. All soggy.
}

HimayoCalamityEvilGift: {
	L0: Hey. Your cuff.
	L1: Shoes picked some up too, right?
	L2: Go wash your hands. Don't touch everything.
}

HimayoSlimeGodGift: {
	L0: Outside's dry enough. Don't rub that on me.
	L1: Take it. Don't ask.
}

HimayoWallOfFleshGift: {
	L0: Wall's down.
	L1: Things will be different from here. Like weather turning.
}

HimayoAquaticScourgeGift: {
	L0: The edge reeks. I live in here. Hard to breathe.
	L1: Next time don't shove the whole blade into that smell.
}

HimayoBrimstoneElementalGift: {
	L0: Heat's still rising. Don't touch that puddle yet.
}

HimayoDestroyerGift: {
	L0: "The Destroyer"... it's just a long piece of iron.
	L1: That thing. Don't drop it.
}

HimayoTwinsGift: {
	L0: Stare at each other too long and people start laughing.
	L1: You know. The more you hold it in, the worse it gets.
}

HimayoSkeletronPrimeGift: {
	L0: Old head, new body... weird.
}

HimayoCalamitasCloneGift: {
	L0: Copying a walk that well is annoying.
	L1: Take it.
}

HimayoPlanteraGift: {
	L0: When a flower's spent, you cut it.
	L1: Leaving the stem doesn't help anyone.
}

HimayoGolemGift: {
	L0: Wrists still numb? Ease your shoulders too.
	L1: Don't bash the blade on stone. It'll chip.
}

HimayoCultistGift: {
	L0: Quiet at the door at last.
}

HimayoMoonLordGift: {
	L0: That thing up there is gone.
	L1: Still on your feet?
}

HimayoProvidenceGift: {
	L0: Air's still hot. Back of the hand feels it.
	L1: Take it.
}

HimayoPolterghastGift: {
	L0: Damp places make things mold.
	L1: Don't sleep here overnight.
}

HimayoDevourerOfGodsGift: {
	L0: Too big. Empty enough to make you dizzy.
	L1: Don't look too long.
}

HimayoYharonGift: {
	L0: Edge is still hot. Warm on my side too.
	L1: Don't sheath it yet.
	L2: Set this aside for now.
}

HimayoExoMechsGift: {
	L0: After all that booming, ears still buzz.
	L1: Want to step away from the noise for a bit?
}

HimayoSupremeCalamitasGift: {
	L0: Over there made the night sticky.
	L1: Go get some air, or wash your face. Don't just stand there.
}

HimayoBossRushGift: {
	L0: Stand still first.
}
